  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">IPAM 2021-25: Solving the Amazon Puzzle: no deforestation, more production and rights</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to reduce deforestation in the Brazilian Amazon by working through five themes: contribute to the end of deforestation on public lands at the hands of land grabbing and land speculation; improve the governance of land use and tenure in undesignated public forests; produce tools to protect the land rights of IPLCs; support the Amazonian states in constructing sustainable initiatives; engage the national and international market forces and consumers.</narrative>
  </description>
